 Encoding_test;n
⍝ Kafka carries bytes. Kafka.Encode makes them (UTF-8, JSON for non-text);
⍝ Kafka.Decode turns them back into text. No broker needed.
 'hello'ExpectEq Kafka.Decode Kafka.Encode'hello'
 'Zoë ⍳⍴'ExpectEq Kafka.Decode Kafka.Encode'Zoë ⍳⍴'       ⍝ Unicode survives
 ExpectTrue 255≥⌈/⎕UCS Kafka.Encode'Zoë ⍳⍴'               ⍝ only byte values on the wire
 '[1,2,3]'ExpectEq Kafka.Decode Kafka.Encode 1 2 3        ⍝ arrays become JSON
 '42'ExpectEq Kafka.Decode Kafka.Encode 42
 n←⎕NS ⍬ ⋄ n.a←1
 '{"a":1}'ExpectEq Kafka.Decode Kafka.Encode n            ⍝ namespaces become JSON objects
 ''ExpectEq Kafka.Decode Kafka.Encode''
